{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43061","headline":"登岳阳楼 · 麻温其","name":"登岳阳楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖边景物属秋天，楼上风光似去年。\n仙侣缑生留福地，湘娥帝子寄哀弦。\n云门自统轩台外，木叶偏飞楚客前。\n极目江山何处是，一帆万里信归船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"麻温其","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}